    "title": "Town zookeeper 'betrayed' by Holtsville Ecology Center closure - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Connor Patton ,\n1 days ago Supporters and opponents of the closing of the zoo at the Holtsville Wildlife & Ecology Center raised their concerns to Brookhaven town officials during an Oct. 9 meeting. Employees of the town’s highway department, along with some residents, spoke out against the closure of what they said was “a community institution,” and felt betrayed by the town’s decision. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
